      Foundational theory establishing that universal evolution originates from
      the first unobserved wavefunction, and that a wavelength coordinate
      represents a specific compression state of a quantum rather than an assigned
      address. Encoded in WNSP spectral identity derivation. 14-act formal
      sequence disclosed 2026-05-16 through 2026-07-19.
  - type: dataset
