    date-released: "2026-04-14"
    repository-code: "https://github.com/nexusosdaily-code/NexusOS"
    notes: >
      Timestamped disclosure of the first successful WNSP-encoded peer-to-peer
      data transmission, with multi-peer confirmation and persistent database
      evidence. Transmission timestamp: 2026-04-14 22:02:28 UTC.
  - type: article
    title: "Act 14 — The Memory: Quantum State Storage and the Bloch Coherence Bound T₂≤2T₁"
    authors:
      - name: "Te Rata Pou"
    year: 2026
    notes: >
      Formal disclosure of the quantum memory layer for WNSP Ψ channel registers.
      Establishes T₂≤2T₁ as the physical memory time limit (Lindblad master
      equation), atomic frequency comb multi-mode capacity M=Γ_inhom/Δ, DLCZ
      heralded entanglement via Raman scattering, and the persistent Ψ register
      architecture (permanent address, transient content). Prior-art Claims 26–29.
      First disclosed 2026-07-19.
